    "updated_at": "2018-10-30T15:01:23Z",
    "body": "I wonder to what extent this feature is supported to begin with (someone recently filed https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1501554 asking for this to be implemented in Firefox).\r\n\r\nI could not find any wpt tests in `html/semantics/embedded-content/the-img-element/`.\r\n\r\nBlame points to d9cff6e9a6fb2928ef5d3f3d8df4e4dd18fb9b4c (part of #52). It's not entirely clear to me if https://github.com/zcorpan/picturefill is the \"ResponsiveImages\" repository or if that's elsewhere, but history there is rather hard to follow.",
